  "description": "## Hive: Masters of the Whispering Woods\n\n\nWelcome to The **Hive**! We&#039;re a group of dedicated players who enjoy working together, sharing resources, and tackling challenges as a team. \n\nIn The Hive, everyone contributes, whether it’s through raids or challenges. We value teamwork, communication, and a friendly atmosphere where all members can grow and enjoy the game.\n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\nMinimum requirements to join may vary—check our Discord for the latest details, rules, and applications. **Discord is mandatory** to be a member of Hive. Buzz on! 🐝\n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n- ##### 🍯  **Discord is** mandatory **to be a member of** Hive - https://discord.gg/ZwgCTvcMr6\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n\n---\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎ \n### 🎫 Participation\n- 🥈 **2nd place**︱Guild Wars #2 - Guardians of the Mountain\n- 🙈 **Until Day 10**︱Guilds Battle Royal\n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n### 🐝 Honored Hive Members\nA special place for those who once filled the Hive with their buzz. Though they’ve moved on, their impact and contributions will always remain part of our story.\n\n**BeePearl** ︱ **ItsPanda**  ︱ **Jmao** ︱ **Username1**\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n‎ ‎ ‎ \n\n📅  Created on 1st August 2024 / LittleBuzz /",
